== r3.99 (C1): a private field or method is reached only in the module of
== its struct, whatever the form of the access.
Use Bank.Accounts

Main :
    A := OpenAccount("Ana")
    D := TAccount(FBalance := 9.99)
    PutLn(D.FOwner)
;
